===Etymology===
{{root|sga|ine-pro|*(s)teg-|id=cover}}
From {{inh|sga|cel-pro|*tegos}}, from {{inh|sga|ine-pro|*(s)tégos||cover, roof}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*(s)teg-||to cover}}; cognate with {{cog|grc|τέγος}}.

The ''-ch'' is analogical to other nouns and adjectives where final non-palatal ''-ch'' alternates with palatal ''-ig''.

